<BaseLayout title="Editorial Desk | Food Supply Crisis Report" description="Learn about the authorship, sourcing and editorial approach used by Food Supply Crisis Report.">
  <section class="section"><div class="shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">Editorial Desk</p>
    <h1>Food Supply Crisis Report Editorial Desk</h1>
    <p>Articles are prepared for a general audience using primary data and reputable reporting wherever possible. Important figures, forecasts and current events are attributed to their sources.</p>
    <p>We do not treat a forecast as a confirmed shortage, and we do not present a local disruption as proof of a worldwide shortage without supporting evidence.</p>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
